**Regression test** — added to `tests/settlement.test.ts`: with all resources at 999 and cap 50, food now clamps to 50 just like wood and stone.

Note: `clampToStorageCap` is only wired into `src/sim/turn.ts:20`, so this was the sole call site — no other code paths needed changing.


